1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,561
(This drama complied with production
guidelines for filming child actors,)

2
00:00:01,563 --> 00:00:02,923
(and some scenes used
generative AI technology.)

3
00:00:03,033 --> 00:00:04,975
Yeong Ju, just give us one year.

4
00:00:05,010 --> 00:00:06,953
Come on, Joong Bin!
Why are you being so pathetic?

5
00:00:07,992 --> 00:00:09,968
- Seriously...
- Wait!

6
00:00:18,602 --> 00:00:20,746
There are a lot of things
I'm worried about,

7
00:00:22,615 --> 00:00:23,621
but I understand.

8
00:00:24,308 --> 00:00:26,933
I'll move in for a year.

9
00:00:28,255 --> 00:00:29,255
Yeong Ju!

10
00:00:29,257 --> 00:00:31,320
Are you really willing to do that?

11
00:00:31,388 --> 00:00:32,388
Will you?

12
00:00:33,189 --> 00:00:34,581
I'll make it up to you.

13
00:00:35,115 --> 00:00:39,149
We went to school together.
Let's get along as sisters-in-law.

14
00:00:39,741 --> 00:00:42,021
I'll be a good sister-in-law to you.

15
00:00:42,917 --> 00:00:45,794
You don't have to.
We'll just live together.

16
00:00:46,162 --> 00:00:47,767
That's what we agreed on.

17
00:00:47,775 --> 00:00:49,981
I raised two sons myself.

18
00:00:50,475 --> 00:00:54,155
Sa Bin really likes and respects you.

19
00:00:55,074 --> 00:00:56,535
I'm worried that after he marries me,

20
00:00:56,549 --> 00:00:59,451
you'll drift apart
and become like strangers.

21
00:01:00,220 --> 00:01:01,712
I don't want to get in the way.

22
00:01:01,806 --> 00:01:02,806
You're right.

23
00:01:02,908 --> 00:01:05,088
Thank you so much. One year will fly by.

24
00:01:05,239 --> 00:01:07,381
Once we're family, you can move out.

25
00:01:07,626 --> 00:01:08,831
I'll do my best too.

26
00:01:09,925 --> 00:01:10,925
Okay.

27
00:01:12,408 --> 00:01:14,376
Are you really okay with this?

28
00:01:16,384 --> 00:01:17,384
I'm okay.

29
00:01:30,161 --> 00:01:31,261
I'm home.

30
00:01:40,821 --> 00:01:41,923
Seung Hyun.

31
00:01:50,735 --> 00:01:51,735
Mom.

32
00:02:03,901 --> 00:02:05,221
You fixed the bathroom door.

33
00:02:05,661 --> 00:02:07,618
Yeah, Seung Woo fixed it.

34
00:02:10,495 --> 00:02:11,915
Try it. It's refreshing.

35
00:02:13,403 --> 00:02:15,275
He came looking for me at the clubs.

36
00:02:15,701 --> 00:02:17,228
He must've searched every club.

37
00:02:18,241 --> 00:02:20,183
He asked me to come
to your wedding with him.

38
00:02:20,685 --> 00:02:23,846
He said we should be on your side
of the family.

39
00:02:25,186 --> 00:02:26,293
Thanks.

40
00:02:27,928 --> 00:02:28,948
I'm sorry.

41
00:02:29,968 --> 00:02:32,474
I took my anger out on you.

42
00:02:34,202 --> 00:02:36,944
You deserve to be happy too.

43
00:02:37,645 --> 00:02:40,274
Seung Woo and I won't stand in your way.

44
00:02:41,461 --> 00:02:44,463
Be happy now, without holding back.
We'll support you.

45
00:02:46,262 --> 00:02:47,995
Thank you. And I'm sorry.

46
00:02:57,954 --> 00:02:58,954
It's good.

47
00:03:02,082 --> 00:03:04,195
How about we have a party tonight?

48
00:03:17,128 --> 00:03:18,128
I'll do it.

49
00:03:18,692 --> 00:03:19,768
Okay. You do it.

50
00:03:19,948 --> 00:03:21,202
I've been doing everything myself
all this time.

51
00:03:21,321 --> 00:03:22,603
You should've come out sooner.

52
00:03:23,764 --> 00:03:24,764
Seriously...

53
00:03:28,015 --> 00:03:29,221
When you weren't around,

54
00:03:29,822 --> 00:03:32,922
I kept saying,
"I'm so glad I'm not an only child."

55
00:03:32,924 --> 00:03:34,002
Seriously.

56
00:03:34,062 --> 00:03:35,942
Mom really does complain a lot.

57
00:03:36,068 --> 00:03:37,301
I never noticed when you were around.

58
00:03:40,161 --> 00:03:41,662
Thanks for coming back as the eldest son.

59
00:03:42,290 --> 00:03:43,297
Seriously...

60
00:03:45,791 --> 00:03:47,176
Give me the tongs. I'll do it.

61
00:03:47,178 --> 00:03:49,745
No, he's doing it. Let's put him to work.

62
00:03:52,600 --> 00:03:53,600
Okay.

63
00:03:54,612 --> 00:03:55,648
I'll do it.

64
00:04:02,802 --> 00:04:03,802
Looks delicious.

65
00:04:06,008 --> 00:04:07,008
What?

66
00:04:08,645 --> 00:04:10,004
No way, Yeong Ju.

67
00:04:10,678 --> 00:04:12,081
You're moving in with them?

68
00:04:13,142 --> 00:04:15,861
Why walk into the tiger's den saying,
"Come get me?"

69
00:04:16,608 --> 00:04:18,188
That wouldn't happen, would it?

70
00:04:19,580 --> 00:04:21,199
You said you'd found a place.

71
00:04:21,285 --> 00:04:23,808
You said it had four bedrooms.
Was that all a lie?

72
00:04:24,781 --> 00:04:27,274
That doctor's a total con artist.

73
00:04:27,895 --> 00:04:30,387
No, we really did find a place.

74
00:04:30,928 --> 00:04:33,215
- But his brother...
- Yeong Ju.

75
00:04:33,502 --> 00:04:35,288
You should've said no.

76
00:04:35,447 --> 00:04:38,514
Once they get you in there,
they'll make your life miserable.

77
00:04:40,170 --> 00:04:42,288
It'll be harder than living separately.

78
00:04:42,656 --> 00:04:44,041
But they're brothers.

79
00:04:44,368 --> 00:04:46,248
They're close, just like you two.

80
00:04:46,629 --> 00:04:48,295
I don't want to tear them apart.

81
00:04:48,801 --> 00:04:50,340
I raised you two.

82
00:04:50,468 --> 00:04:52,708
- How could I tear another family apart?
- Mom.

83
00:04:53,408 --> 00:04:56,535
I came home after giving them that answer,
and here you were.

84
00:04:57,228 --> 00:04:59,755
It felt like getting a reward.
I felt like I'd done the right thing.

85
00:05:01,002 --> 00:05:04,915
I went through so much looking for him.
It wasn't some reward for you.

86
00:05:05,155 --> 00:05:06,155
Yeong Ju.

87
00:05:06,430 --> 00:05:09,518
Haven't you heard?
One decision can shape the next ten years.

88
00:05:09,961 --> 00:05:10,961
Ma'am.

89
00:05:14,417 --> 00:05:16,341
It's only for a year. Exactly one year.

90
00:05:17,502 --> 00:05:20,328
That's plenty of time
for me to get close to his family.

91
00:05:20,875 --> 00:05:23,601
Sa Bin will be there to help me.

92
00:05:29,961 --> 00:05:32,553
- Let's eat before the meat gets cold.
- Yeah.

93
00:05:32,581 --> 00:05:33,581
Eat up.

94
00:05:36,874 --> 00:05:37,874
Joong Bin, see?

95
00:05:38,658 --> 00:05:40,422
That's the kind of woman Yeong Ju is.

96
00:05:40,768 --> 00:05:43,515
If love had a name, it'd be No Yeong Ju.

97
00:05:44,296 --> 00:05:45,611
You're spitting on me.

98
00:05:46,233 --> 00:05:47,446
Sorry.

99
00:05:48,853 --> 00:05:52,000
Sun Kyung, please take good care of her.

100
00:05:52,002 --> 00:05:54,426
If you two become close
and treat her well,

101
00:05:54,428 --> 00:05:56,628
I'll be grateful to you
for the rest of my life.

102
00:05:59,194 --> 00:06:02,069
You must be really happy.
You haven't stopped smiling.

103
00:06:02,071 --> 00:06:03,768
Of course I am.

104
00:06:05,675 --> 00:06:08,401
Come to think of it,
you're my brother-in-law's wife.

105
00:06:11,162 --> 00:06:12,721
I look forward to getting along with you.

106
00:06:12,968 --> 00:06:15,288
Why are you making things awkward?

107
00:06:15,809 --> 00:06:16,809
What?

108
00:06:17,081 --> 00:06:19,990
Keep it down. You're giving me a headache.

109
00:06:20,758 --> 00:06:21,758
Okay.

110
00:06:23,361 --> 00:06:25,149
I'm having a little indigestion.

111
00:06:25,387 --> 00:06:27,495
- Joong Bin, I'm going to lie down.
- Okay.

112
00:06:37,742 --> 00:06:39,268
Read the room, you idiot.

113
00:06:39,655 --> 00:06:41,388
Why bring up your
brother-in-law's wife too?

114
00:06:41,728 --> 00:06:43,561
People are already complaining
about how complicated this family tree is.

115
00:06:43,629 --> 00:06:44,903
But it's true.

116
00:06:55,828 --> 00:06:57,368
You don't have to go that far.

117
00:06:57,655 --> 00:07:01,155
Still, if Yeong Ju moves in,
we'll feel uncomfortable.

118
00:07:02,041 --> 00:07:03,788
My wife's already uncomfortable with it.

119
00:07:03,789 --> 00:07:05,888
So what, we're supposed to break up?
That's ridiculous.

120
00:07:07,554 --> 00:07:09,514
They'll move out in a year.
Just put up with it for a year.

121
00:07:10,494 --> 00:07:13,567
You're my man for life,
so don't get any silly ideas.

122
00:07:16,594 --> 00:07:19,748
I'm truly sorry
for putting you through all this.

123
00:07:21,321 --> 00:07:23,558
The man you deserted the army to kill...

124
00:07:23,647 --> 00:07:25,578
was Yeong Ju's ex-husband, right?

125
00:07:25,580 --> 00:07:26,580
Yes.

126
00:07:26,742 --> 00:07:28,535
He died of an illness recently.

127
00:07:29,435 --> 00:07:31,885
Anyway, now that we're even closer,

128
00:07:31,894 --> 00:07:33,204
don't feel so uncomfortable.

129
00:07:33,945 --> 00:07:34,945
Yes.

130
00:07:36,328 --> 00:07:37,655
I'll do better.

131
00:07:44,601 --> 00:07:47,028
This is quite a predicament.

132
00:07:52,614 --> 00:07:53,687
No Yeong Ju.

133
00:07:54,518 --> 00:07:57,011
How dare you think
you can become part of my family?

134
00:08:00,622 --> 00:08:02,278
What am I going to do?

135
00:08:02,552 --> 00:08:04,508
I don't want that.

136
00:08:16,828 --> 00:08:18,035
Thanks for your hard work.

137
00:08:23,260 --> 00:08:24,613
Ji Ni, give them some over there too.

138
00:08:24,642 --> 00:08:26,902
Is this what you meant
when you said you'd bring coffee?

139
00:08:27,721 --> 00:08:28,881
You really went all out.

140
00:08:28,889 --> 00:08:31,824
There are so many people here.
We're short-handed. We need a truck.

141
00:08:32,039 --> 00:08:33,101
Yes.

142
00:08:33,175 --> 00:08:34,846
- Must be nice being rich.
- Ji Ni, you're here?

143
00:08:35,007 --> 00:08:36,408
- You're here?
- Yeah.

144
00:08:36,575 --> 00:08:38,799
You actually brought a coffee truck?

145
00:08:38,801 --> 00:08:41,521
- This is amazing.
- I know.

146
00:08:42,702 --> 00:08:43,928
Did I do something wrong?

147
00:08:44,768 --> 00:08:46,088
That's not it.

148
00:08:46,542 --> 00:08:48,282
It's just such a huge difference.

149
00:08:48,316 --> 00:08:49,615
I mean, the difference in wealth.

150
00:08:50,701 --> 00:08:53,581
Coffee trucks are popular these days,
so I thought it'd be a nice surprise.

151
00:09:00,308 --> 00:09:01,488
Ji Hu?

152
00:09:02,648 --> 00:09:03,648
Ji Hu.

153
00:09:04,857 --> 00:09:07,387
Did you bring a coffee truck
to support Jung A?

154
00:09:08,054 --> 00:09:09,127
With Na Ji Ni?

155
00:09:10,388 --> 00:09:11,977
We came to support the director too.

156
00:09:12,908 --> 00:09:14,315
How do you know our director?

157
00:09:14,648 --> 00:09:15,648
We just know each other.

158
00:09:16,402 --> 00:09:17,482
Want a drink?

159
00:09:26,721 --> 00:09:27,721
Seriously...

160
00:09:30,802 --> 00:09:31,802
What's wrong with her?

161
00:09:47,742 --> 00:09:50,786
Even when I told you my mom beat me,
you didn't come,

162
00:09:51,121 --> 00:09:52,168
and now you show up like this?

163
00:09:52,388 --> 00:09:53,955
Do you have to treat me like this?

164
00:09:54,968 --> 00:09:56,420
I'm really hurt.

165
00:09:56,421 --> 00:09:58,175
- Do Hee.
- Do you have to be so cruel?

166
00:09:58,281 --> 00:09:59,457
Do you hate me that much?

167
00:10:00,009 --> 00:10:01,608
I've been sick for three days.

168
00:10:01,815 --> 00:10:03,329
Do you know how lonely I've been?

169
00:10:04,021 --> 00:10:05,021
I...

170
00:10:06,355 --> 00:10:08,368
I don't even have any friends.

171
00:10:23,018 --> 00:10:25,621
Sir, let's take a picture together.

172
00:10:26,482 --> 00:10:27,588
It'll only take a second.

173
00:10:29,555 --> 00:10:32,365
Why are you here? Do Do Hee left crying.

174
00:10:33,105 --> 00:10:34,373
We're breaking up.

175
00:10:34,862 --> 00:10:36,333
If I go now, it'll only make things worse.

176
00:10:38,134 --> 00:10:39,441
Sir.

177
00:10:42,302 --> 00:10:43,302
You're here?

178
00:10:43,357 --> 00:10:44,357
Yeah.

179
00:10:46,004 --> 00:10:47,019
Thanks for the coffee.

180
00:10:47,853 --> 00:10:48,853
Sir!

181
00:10:51,835 --> 00:10:52,915
I'll give it to him later.

182
00:10:53,528 --> 00:10:54,528
It's okay.

183
00:11:01,747 --> 00:11:03,387
Im Ji Hu, you're not coming, are you?

184
00:11:04,381 --> 00:11:05,479
You really...

185
00:11:17,268 --> 00:11:18,268
Do Hee.

186
00:11:19,282 --> 00:11:20,381
What happened?

187
00:11:23,195 --> 00:11:24,597
Everyone else is doing fine,

188
00:11:25,738 --> 00:11:27,195
but I feel like
I'm the only one struggling.

189
00:11:31,641 --> 00:11:33,327
Your mom really went too far.

190
00:11:33,421 --> 00:11:34,875
It's all because of Ji Ni.

191
00:11:35,462 --> 00:11:36,462
"Ji Ni?"

192
00:11:37,015 --> 00:11:38,055
What do you mean?

193
00:11:38,148 --> 00:11:40,392
Sir, do you know Ji Ni?

194
00:11:41,393 --> 00:11:42,731
How long have you known her?

195
00:11:43,172 --> 00:11:44,508
What about Ji Hu?

196
00:11:44,762 --> 00:11:45,918
"Ji Hu?"

197
00:11:47,915 --> 00:11:49,555
He's actually my boyfriend.

198
00:11:50,367 --> 00:11:52,527
But I think
Ji Ni's going to take him away from me.

199
00:11:53,648 --> 00:11:56,495
You're saying he was your fiancé?

200
00:11:58,060 --> 00:12:01,033
Na Ji Ni has been through a lot, you know.

201
00:12:01,601 --> 00:12:03,738
This may be a bit much to say.

202
00:12:05,099 --> 00:12:07,021
Her mom was another man's mistress.

203
00:12:10,635 --> 00:12:12,058
She's just like her mom.

204
00:12:12,079 --> 00:12:15,007
She bats her eyes
and steals other women's men for fun.

205
00:12:15,915 --> 00:12:18,228
She caused so much trouble in school too.

206
00:12:18,741 --> 00:12:20,588
She knows her blood is dirty.

207
00:12:21,195 --> 00:12:23,148
Like mother, like daughter.

208
00:12:26,795 --> 00:12:27,795
Anyway,

209
00:12:28,529 --> 00:12:30,161
take some time to calm down here.

210
00:12:30,755 --> 00:12:31,884
And wipe your tears.

211
00:12:32,693 --> 00:12:34,177
You should touch up your makeup too.

212
00:12:36,334 --> 00:12:38,034
It's hard for me to see Ji Ni.

213
00:12:39,028 --> 00:12:40,708
I'm still so scared.

214
00:12:42,347 --> 00:12:44,352
It reminds me of being locked
in that storage room.

215
00:12:46,488 --> 00:12:47,521
I'm scared.

216
00:12:49,835 --> 00:12:51,367
You were locked in a storage room?

217
00:12:52,275 --> 00:12:53,793
I'm scared of my mom too.

218
00:12:54,493 --> 00:12:55,939
And Ji Ni makes things so hard.

219
00:12:57,154 --> 00:12:58,541
What am I supposed to do?

220
00:13:00,075 --> 00:13:01,094
Anyway,

221
00:13:02,342 --> 00:13:03,983
just focus on the shoot today.

222
00:13:05,090 --> 00:13:06,104
I will.

223
00:13:07,511 --> 00:13:09,148
Thank you for listening.

224
00:13:33,001 --> 00:13:34,994
- How far did you get?
- Yes, sir.

225
00:13:35,582 --> 00:13:36,928
We finished reading up to here.

226
00:13:37,169 --> 00:13:39,061
- Hey...
- Okay.

227
00:13:41,268 --> 00:13:42,651
- Are you done with the sketch?
- Yes.

228
00:13:43,334 --> 00:13:45,486
We'll move slightly forward when we film.

229
00:13:45,487 --> 00:13:46,581
Yes, understood.

230
00:14:00,701 --> 00:14:03,375
- Done having fun?
- Jealous because we had fun without you?

231
00:14:03,400 --> 00:14:05,637
Then try being nice for once.

232
00:14:06,548 --> 00:14:08,291
But did you really break up with Ji Hu?

233
00:14:08,316 --> 00:14:09,715
He doesn't even acknowledge you.

234
00:14:09,740 --> 00:14:11,018
Mind your own business.

235
00:14:11,382 --> 00:14:12,801
Even if he dumped me,
you're not an option.

236
00:14:12,803 --> 00:14:14,318
So you really did break up.

237
00:14:14,320 --> 00:14:15,489
I said we didn't!

238
00:14:15,514 --> 00:14:17,107
Why are you yelling again?

239
00:14:17,132 --> 00:14:18,181
Fighting again?

240
00:14:18,206 --> 00:14:20,614
I told you I wouldn't let you walk
all over me like you did with Ji Ni!

241
00:14:21,269 --> 00:14:22,269
Hey!

242
00:14:22,509 --> 00:14:24,748
Honestly, what did I ever do to you?

243
00:14:24,772 --> 00:14:25,772
What?

244
00:14:27,837 --> 00:14:31,090
Fine! I did bully Ji Ni a little.

245
00:14:31,115 --> 00:14:32,115
But what about you?

246
00:14:32,569 --> 00:14:33,889
What did I ever do to you?

247
00:14:33,914 --> 00:14:36,146
I'm Ji Ni's friend.

248
00:14:36,374 --> 00:14:38,228
You wouldn't understand
since you have no friends.

249
00:14:38,252 --> 00:14:39,545
You're her friend?

250
00:14:40,315 --> 00:14:42,004
Does Na Ji Ni even think of you as one?

251
00:14:42,548 --> 00:14:45,788
To everyone else, you're just her servant.

252
00:14:46,139 --> 00:14:47,383
Wake up.

253
00:14:48,915 --> 00:14:51,237
How long are you going to live
in Ji Ni's shadow?

254
00:14:51,361 --> 00:14:52,941
You pathetic little servant.

255
00:14:56,441 --> 00:14:58,592
Crazy bitch. What is she saying?

256
00:15:05,736 --> 00:15:06,955
That little...

257
00:15:06,980 --> 00:15:08,700
Hey, Do Do Hee! Stop right there!

258
00:15:18,375 --> 00:15:20,361
About what you said last time.

259
00:15:21,355 --> 00:15:23,701
I've thought a lot about my own birth too.

260
00:15:26,427 --> 00:15:27,821
I don't have an answer, but...

261
00:15:28,561 --> 00:15:31,548
I believe no one is born
into this world for no reason.

262
00:15:32,029 --> 00:15:33,029
Don't you think?

263
00:15:34,035 --> 00:15:36,624
Our birth may have brought misfortune
to someone...

264
00:15:37,575 --> 00:15:39,190
and we may have been abandoned,

265
00:15:39,846 --> 00:15:40,846
but we...

266
00:15:41,901 --> 00:15:44,062
were protected by someone
who carried us for ten months,

267
00:15:45,741 --> 00:15:48,061
and someone waited ten months for us.

268
00:15:48,600 --> 00:15:50,471
So, if only out of gratitude for that,

269
00:15:51,097 --> 00:15:54,041
let's try to live our lives
as fully as we can.

270
00:15:58,219 --> 00:15:59,488
Why are you looking at me like that?

271
00:15:59,793 --> 00:16:01,181
It's nothing.

272
00:16:02,329 --> 00:16:03,527
You're good at comforting people.

273
00:16:05,255 --> 00:16:08,166
Maybe your feelings
come through in your art.

274
00:16:08,682 --> 00:16:10,912
I think the comfort I felt
in your paintings...

275
00:16:10,936 --> 00:16:12,326
may have come from this.

276
00:16:13,400 --> 00:16:15,990
I'm glad my paintings comforted you.

277
00:16:21,953 --> 00:16:23,352
She's just like her mom.

278
00:16:23,354 --> 00:16:26,387
She bats her eyes
and steals other women's men for fun.

279
00:16:32,445 --> 00:16:33,932
Where's Do Do Hee?

280
00:16:34,152 --> 00:16:35,227
Do Do Hee!

281
00:16:35,502 --> 00:16:37,686
Where's Do Do Hee? Come out here!

282
00:16:40,255 --> 00:16:41,418
Sir!

283
00:16:41,442 --> 00:16:42,678
What's wrong, Jung A?

284
00:16:42,703 --> 00:16:45,581
That crazy bitch Do Hee put a needle
inside my lipstick!

285
00:16:46,981 --> 00:16:48,507
How does that make any sense?

286
00:16:48,531 --> 00:16:50,382
Look at this. It was her, I swear.

287
00:16:51,170 --> 00:16:52,170
What's going on?

288
00:16:52,468 --> 00:16:53,628
Where's Do Hee?

289
00:16:53,773 --> 00:16:55,457
That bitch is dead meat.

290
00:16:55,482 --> 00:16:57,009
Do you have any proof she did it?

291
00:16:57,342 --> 00:16:58,904
What makes you say that?

292
00:16:59,668 --> 00:17:00,890
Sir...

293
00:17:01,550 --> 00:17:03,449
I told you,
she tried to split my lip open!

294
00:17:03,474 --> 00:17:04,991
Do Hee did this to me!

295
00:17:05,802 --> 00:17:07,292
I'll bet my hand on it.

296
00:17:07,409 --> 00:17:08,934
You know
these are an artist's hands, right?

297
00:17:09,599 --> 00:17:10,599
Look.

298
00:17:19,940 --> 00:17:21,175
Sir.

299
00:17:29,341 --> 00:17:30,808
Sir...

300
00:17:32,295 --> 00:17:33,345
Are you okay?

301
00:17:37,188 --> 00:17:39,790
It was you, wasn't it? I know it was!

302
00:17:41,022 --> 00:17:43,281
Enough. Can't you see she's crying?

303
00:17:43,305 --> 00:17:45,013
This is driving me crazy.

304
00:17:45,038 --> 00:17:48,058
- Sir, why are you doing this?
- What do you mean?

305
00:17:48,083 --> 00:17:49,235
Just stop it!

306
00:17:50,053 --> 00:17:51,233
We have a shoot to do.

307
00:17:53,080 --> 00:17:54,494
Sir!

308
00:18:14,028 --> 00:18:15,102
Mom, what are you doing?

309
00:18:15,452 --> 00:18:16,987
What do you think? I'm making dinner.

310
00:18:17,012 --> 00:18:19,254
Good, you're here. Peel some potatoes.

311
00:18:19,279 --> 00:18:21,575
- I'm going shopping with Yeong Ju.
- What?

312
00:18:21,907 --> 00:18:24,409
She's getting married.
Why are you the one so busy?

313
00:18:24,822 --> 00:18:29,279
She says I have great taste
and always pick classy things.

314
00:18:29,358 --> 00:18:30,745
You know I'm an art student.

315
00:18:31,182 --> 00:18:33,096
She'll buy me some clothes too,

316
00:18:33,127 --> 00:18:34,882
to thank me for helping with the proposal.

317
00:18:36,081 --> 00:18:37,085
See you later.

318
00:18:37,276 --> 00:18:38,651
Fine, go.

319
00:18:40,111 --> 00:18:41,404
Go on.

320
00:18:41,429 --> 00:18:44,512
Yeong Ju can go get married.
Sa Bin can go too.

321
00:18:44,829 --> 00:18:47,798
Even the bean sprout heads can go.
Everyone, just go!

322
00:19:14,761 --> 00:19:17,312
My princess. No, my queen.

323
00:19:17,336 --> 00:19:18,366
My goddess!

324
00:19:19,661 --> 00:19:22,210
Sa Bin, I'm really uncomfortable.

325
00:19:22,364 --> 00:19:24,036
I don't even know what to choose.

326
00:19:24,460 --> 00:19:26,302
Can't we shop for their things first?

327
00:19:26,327 --> 00:19:28,522
But you look beautiful.

328
00:19:28,547 --> 00:19:30,208
That's not what I'm talking about.

329
00:19:30,233 --> 00:19:32,307
Let's buy your clothes first.

330
00:19:32,331 --> 00:19:33,937
Why? We're good.

331
00:19:33,948 --> 00:19:35,939
I think we can just wear these out.

332
00:19:35,994 --> 00:19:37,479
We have something to do,
just the two of us.

333
00:19:37,504 --> 00:19:40,107
- We'll just wear these out.
- Sa Bin.

334
00:19:46,794 --> 00:19:48,738
Stand close to your uncle.

335
00:19:49,495 --> 00:19:50,934
We might get photographed.

336
00:19:51,189 --> 00:19:52,668
Let's be careful, just in case.

337
00:20:03,026 --> 00:20:04,720
Looks great. Don't you think?

338
00:20:04,722 --> 00:20:06,634
Focus. You're forgetting why we came here.

339
00:20:06,971 --> 00:20:08,777
What? Can't I even try it on?

340
00:20:08,802 --> 00:20:10,116
This is my chance to wear one.

341
00:20:10,275 --> 00:20:11,455
Just hurry up and choose.

342
00:20:12,616 --> 00:20:14,267
- Old man.
- Man-child.

343
00:20:14,292 --> 00:20:17,745
Do you know how hard I worked
filling in as the eldest son?

344
00:20:17,770 --> 00:20:19,685
You haven't even thanked me
for everything I've done.

345
00:20:19,709 --> 00:20:21,388
Enough. Keep your voice down.

346
00:20:22,505 --> 00:20:23,512
How about this one?

347
00:20:24,134 --> 00:20:25,389
I wouldn't wear it.

348
00:20:25,414 --> 00:20:26,648
I told you, it's not for you.

349
00:20:27,457 --> 00:20:28,979
- We'll take this.
- Okay.

350
00:20:34,541 --> 00:20:36,543
Nice colors.

351
00:20:37,660 --> 00:20:39,380
A little gift for the bride-to-be.

352
00:20:39,492 --> 00:20:42,430
Your sister-in-law's a classy lady, right?

353
00:20:42,545 --> 00:20:43,971
Wear it with confidence.

354
00:20:43,988 --> 00:20:46,158
Since when were you this supportive?

355
00:20:47,121 --> 00:20:50,330
It's nice when your husband's friend
wants to get along with you.

356
00:20:52,183 --> 00:20:53,183
What about the dress?

357
00:20:53,295 --> 00:20:55,207
I couldn't choose one.

358
00:20:55,638 --> 00:20:58,024
Look at this. Ji Ni took this photo.

359
00:20:58,738 --> 00:20:59,738
Let me see.

360
00:21:02,050 --> 00:21:03,050
It's not great, is it?

361
00:21:04,945 --> 00:21:06,741
If this is the kind of dress you want,

362
00:21:06,918 --> 00:21:09,483
the dress I wore at my recital
would look much better.

363
00:21:09,814 --> 00:21:11,282
- Really?
- Yeah.

364
00:21:12,653 --> 00:21:15,913
Why don't we alter my dress for you?

365
00:21:15,939 --> 00:21:17,733
We can change the beading...

366
00:21:17,961 --> 00:21:19,405
and give it some sleeves.

367
00:21:19,430 --> 00:21:21,932
- Sleeveless might be too revealing.
- Exactly.

368
00:21:21,957 --> 00:21:23,656
I can't get Sa Bin to understand.

369
00:21:23,682 --> 00:21:25,216
He thinks every dress looks good.

370
00:21:25,240 --> 00:21:28,020
Of course. What do men know?

371
00:21:28,130 --> 00:21:30,252
Leave it to me.
I'll take care of everything.

372
00:21:30,565 --> 00:21:32,950
Your dress? Let me see it now.

373
00:21:32,998 --> 00:21:35,179
It's in Senior Kim's storage room.

374
00:21:35,279 --> 00:21:37,240
I couldn't bring all my things
when I came here.

375
00:21:37,242 --> 00:21:39,297
So I left it there with my tableware.

376
00:21:39,299 --> 00:21:40,611
I'll bring it tomorrow.

377
00:21:41,982 --> 00:21:43,303
Consider it my wedding gift.

378
00:21:43,886 --> 00:21:44,903
Really?

379
00:21:45,845 --> 00:21:46,845
Why?

380
00:21:46,877 --> 00:21:50,368
This whole situation feels strange.

381
00:21:51,262 --> 00:21:53,154
Who would've thought
you'd be making my dress?

382
00:21:54,235 --> 00:21:56,871
I can't believe this is happening.

383
00:21:58,743 --> 00:21:59,743
Neither can I.

384
00:22:00,415 --> 00:22:01,415
Seriously.

385
00:22:08,348 --> 00:22:10,054
Here for the bride's mother's outfit?

386
00:22:10,102 --> 00:22:11,770
Which one of you is the bride's mother?

387
00:22:11,916 --> 00:22:14,681
Hanbok for the mothers
looks gorgeous these days.

388
00:22:15,502 --> 00:22:16,720
Neither of us is the bride's mother.

389
00:22:16,829 --> 00:22:18,262
We're here for her bridal hanbok.

390
00:22:20,879 --> 00:22:23,494
I'm getting remarried.

391
00:22:23,821 --> 00:22:25,109
She's my future sister-in-law.

392
00:22:25,134 --> 00:22:26,735
Please help me choose a nice one.

393
00:22:26,806 --> 00:22:29,048
That's wonderful.

394
00:22:30,155 --> 00:22:31,155
You think so?

395
00:22:31,766 --> 00:22:33,409
Second and third marriages
are common these days.

396
00:22:33,434 --> 00:22:36,466
Bottling things up will make you sick.

397
00:22:36,490 --> 00:22:37,936
Just a moment.

398
00:22:43,548 --> 00:22:44,703
How about this one?

399
00:22:48,808 --> 00:22:49,808
It looks lovely.

400
00:22:51,038 --> 00:22:52,661
What do you think?

401
00:22:54,074 --> 00:22:55,074
It's nice.

402
00:22:55,465 --> 00:22:56,811
Choose whichever one you like.

403
00:23:08,581 --> 00:23:10,809
But which side do we sit on,
the bride's or the groom's?

404
00:23:11,922 --> 00:23:13,480
You sit on the bride's side.

405
00:23:13,842 --> 00:23:15,559
I'm definitely sitting with the General.

406
00:23:15,803 --> 00:23:17,083
You want us to sit apart?

407
00:23:18,942 --> 00:23:20,656
Then come over to this side.

408
00:23:25,238 --> 00:23:26,561
Mom, you look gorgeous.

409
00:23:27,235 --> 00:23:28,896
Mom, let's take one with the bouquet.

410
00:23:31,187 --> 00:23:32,988
- A little higher.
- Like this?

411
00:23:33,780 --> 00:23:36,656
Okay. Tilt your head.

412
00:23:36,681 --> 00:23:37,813
Okay.

413
00:23:45,817 --> 00:23:50,266
The wedding ceremony of groom Im Sa Bin
and bride No Yeong Ju...

414
00:23:50,290 --> 00:23:52,805
will now begin.

415
00:23:53,091 --> 00:23:57,372
Please welcome the bride and groom
with loud cheers and applause.

416
00:23:57,652 --> 00:23:59,134
Now, for the groom's entrance.

417
00:23:59,400 --> 00:24:00,400
Here comes...

418
00:24:01,436 --> 00:24:02,436
the groom!

419
00:24:03,827 --> 00:24:05,736
Please give him a warm round of applause.

420
00:24:10,714 --> 00:24:11,714
Let's go!

421
00:24:21,415 --> 00:24:23,275
Now, for the bride's entrance.

422
00:24:23,300 --> 00:24:27,672
The most beautiful bride in the world,
more beautiful than any flower,

423
00:24:27,785 --> 00:24:29,649
is waiting to make her entrance.

424
00:24:29,666 --> 00:24:33,184
Please welcome the bride
with loud cheers and applause.

425
00:24:33,185 --> 00:24:34,185
Here comes...

426
00:24:35,520 --> 00:24:36,520
the bride!

427
00:24:42,762 --> 00:24:44,749
Please give her a warm round of applause.

428
00:25:10,676 --> 00:25:12,379
Please give a big round of applause...

429
00:25:12,403 --> 00:25:14,189
to the couple
starting their new life together.

430
00:25:39,821 --> 00:25:40,844
Honey.

431
00:25:42,444 --> 00:25:44,053
Yeong Ju...

432
00:25:45,601 --> 00:25:50,234
is finally getting remarried today,
just as we'd always hoped.

433
00:25:54,315 --> 00:25:56,006
It took a long time, didn't it?

434
00:26:01,863 --> 00:26:03,216
Honey, now...

435
00:26:03,439 --> 00:26:04,456
you...

436
00:26:06,562 --> 00:26:08,382
don't have to worry about Yeong Ju.

437
00:26:43,751 --> 00:26:44,998
Get the groom in here too!

438
00:26:46,528 --> 00:26:48,748
- You can do it!
- Hey, don't!

439
00:27:50,761 --> 00:27:53,924
(Family Register)

440
00:27:53,995 --> 00:27:55,063
He's exactly my type.

441
00:27:55,088 --> 00:27:57,702
- But I heard you're engaged...
- My fiancé is cheating on me...

442
00:27:57,727 --> 00:27:58,792
with my friend, too.

443
00:27:58,817 --> 00:27:59,956
She must act differently with us...

444
00:27:59,980 --> 00:28:02,064
than she does with her friends.

445
00:28:02,089 --> 00:28:03,291
Do you plan to keep it here?

446
00:28:03,316 --> 00:28:05,442
Your mom remarried. We should let this go.

447
00:28:05,467 --> 00:28:07,122
I'll keep it exactly as Mom left it.

448
00:28:07,147 --> 00:28:08,587
Why must you argue over everything?

449
00:28:08,611 --> 00:28:09,707
Let's go home. I'll drive.

450
00:28:09,732 --> 00:28:11,493
- No, I'll take a taxi.
- Do I make you uncomfortable?

451
00:28:11,523 --> 00:28:12,956
- Let's keep things professional.
- Want a ride?

452
00:28:12,975 --> 00:28:13,975
Sure.

453
00:28:15,148 --> 00:28:17,148
(Subtitles are provided by KOCOWA.)
